What the EUPL does not cover
----------------------------

The EUPL covers Fenmyr's code. It does not cover the following, which remain
all rights reserved by Stephen Chiang. See TRADEMARKS.md.

- The name "Fenmyr" for this app, and the Fenmyr logo and app icon (assets/,
  tools/make-icon.ts).
- The name "Myra" for the assistant, and Myra the cloudberry character in any
  form: her drawing in the code (src/web/goo.ts), her stickers
  (web/stamps/myra-*) and any art of her.
- Fenmyr's and Myra's own art and illustrations: the stamp set (web/stamps/),
  and the cover and other images in assets/.
- Their own icons: the cloudberry mark, the Myra tool and the chat icon
  (tools/icons/custom.ts), and the cloudberry glyph font
  (web/fonts/MyraMark.woff2).


